
# POWER BI Report

The Power BI report contains 8 pages covering
Sales, Customers, Products, Orders and Business KPI's.


Key Power BI features include:
- Power Query
- Data Modelling
- Relationships
- Date Table
- DAX Measures
- Conditional Formatting
- Drillthrough
- Tooltips
- Static RLS
- Dynamic RLS


